<title>GERMANY: Buba's Issing - Bonn plan &quot;more creative&quot; than rest.</title>
<headline>Buba's Issing - Bonn plan &quot;more creative&quot; than rest.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bundesbank chief economist Otmar Issing condemned a Bonn plan to drum up extra profit by revaluing the Bundesbank reserves.</p>
<p>&quot;This is even more creative than steps taken in other countries,&quot; he told Reuters on the fringes of a reception in Frankfurt.</p>
</text>
